{"skill":{"slug":"ppt-generator","displayName":"description: 将用户讲稿一键生成乔布斯风极简科技感竖屏HTML演示稿。当用户需要生成PPT、演示文稿、Slides、幻灯片，或要求科技风/极简风/乔布斯风格的演示时触发此技能。输出为单个可直接运行的HTML文件。"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770200473886,"changelog":"ppt-generator 1.0.0 初始版本发布\n\n- 将用户讲稿一键转换为乔布斯风极简科技感9:16竖屏HTML演示稿。\n- 输出包含：提炼后的讲稿（Markdown）、幻灯片结构大纲、完整HTML代码。\n- 严格遵循极简、一屏一事、强视觉对比与留白等设计原则。\n- 由TailwindCSS与Vue3（CDN）驱动，输出单个HTML文件，开箱即用。\n- 支持键盘翻页、底部进度条和平滑动画等重点交互。","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":2364,"sha256":"ccb5f7210040e5f1104e49b90b7545ac818358d24c85096bad04f1871e9c24af","contentType":null},{"path":"assets/template.html","size":7867,"sha256":"3213560e16e3d320bb21ffd01a7921c07c55e966a8277e7cf2ebae572fbd46b8","contentType":"text/html"},{"path":"agents/openai.yaml","size":194,"sha256":"34339ed6a8bfd7e7222822808bd4e64e99f5615d469e9219c555eeb792e40f9e","contentType":"application/x-yaml"},{"path":"references/slide-types.md","size":3640,"sha256":"9898344bcf001034ea222a475910e1c9469e5b848df4f699b988f888ec016ea6","contentType":null},{"path":"references/design-spec.md","size":2310,"sha256":"f8e58d710c6a6364ade8f2fa130ab76c298bad5a41234046947cefc04b063df0","contentType":null},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1984,"sha256":"122653b279d60fd4043ab9a00168c11edba54923bac98091b1db6756029e917d","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789032452967,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"308d0168f9123d876c6cc078d2c7f95cda76d4544f11b0b46deb9220cda004cf","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/308d0168f9123d876c6cc078d2c7f95cda76d4544f11b0b46deb9220cda004cf","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: ppt-generator\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill is designed to generate a minimalist HTML presentation. The `SKILL.md` instructions guide the AI agent through a clear, step-by-step process for content generation and HTML assembly, without any directives to ignore user safety, access unrelated sensitive data, or perform actions beyond its stated purpose. The `assets/template.html` and `references/design-spec.md` files include links to external CDNs for web assets like TailwindCSS and fonts (e.g., `bytecdntp.com`, `fonts.loli.net`, `hdslb.com`). While `fonts.loli.net` is a third-party proxy for Google Fonts, its use in a generated HTML file for styling is a common web development practice and does not indicate malicious intent or high-risk behavior from the skill itself, as the agent is instructed to *generate* the HTML, not execute arbitrary code from these sources on the host system. No evidence of data exfiltration, malicious execution, persistence, or obfuscation was found.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779161273786},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":67,"severity":"HIGH","recommendation":"DO_NOT_INSTALL","issueCount":10,"checkedAt":1789032452967},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"medium","summary":"This skill coherently generates Chinese vertical HTML presentations, but users should know its generated files load external CDN resources.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Generated HTML uses third-party CDNs for TailwindCSS and fonts, which is proportionate to the presentation purpose but means the output is not fully offline or self-contained.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The artifact contains markdown, YAML metadata, references, and an HTML template; no installer, shell command, package install, or privileged setup was found.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The activation language is somewhat broad for PPT, slides, tech, minimalist, or Jobs-style requests, and the skill is strongly Chinese-language oriented.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No persistence, credential access, local profile/session access, background worker, memory modification, or privilege escalation behavior was found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The instructions, template, and references consistently support converting a user manuscript into a minimalist 9:16 HTML slide deck.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install this if you want a Chinese-language, Jobs-style HTML slide generator. Review generated presentations before sharing, and avoid opening highly sensitive decks while online unless you are comfortable with the template fetching TailwindCSS and fonts from third-party CDNs.","findings":"[AE1] unexpected: Downgraded: the referenced assets/template.html file is present in the artifact and was fully inspected during this adjudication.\n[SQP-1] expected: The trigger is broad, but it remains centered on presentation generation and does not grant sensitive authority or hidden tool use.\n[SQP-3] expected: The Chinese language and locale choices are consistent across the skill and template; this is a usability and expectation note rather than a security concern.\n[SDI-1] expected: Accepted as a real disclosure concern: the template loads TailwindCSS and fonts from external CDNs, so opened presentations make network requests.\n[SDI-2] expected: The remote styling dependencies are not strictly required for slide navigation, but they are visible in the template and aligned with visual presentation generation.\n[T08] expected: Accepted as a medium-risk dependency concern: the Tailwind CDN script is remote executable JavaScript without SRI, but no artifact-backed malicious payload or privilege expansion was found.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789032452967}}}}}